window.products.push({"id":1122014,"name":"Dream Catcher Grey Feather Dream Catchers Handmade Native American Circle Craft Dream Catcher for Wall Hanging Decoration Ornament Home Decor Room Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t8LzZemVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Handmade Feather Dream Catchers Wall Hanging Home Decor for Kids Girls Boys Bedroom Dream Catcher History & Legend:  Hanging dream catcher is a traditional culture of Native Americans, which was originated from the 18th century.They believed that the night air is filled with good and bad dreams. A dreamcatcher capture nice dreams and bring blessings. The traditional dream catcher was intended to protect the sleeping individual from negative dreams, while it lets positive dreams pass through the holes and slide down the soft feathers to the sleeping person. The bad dreams would be trapped in in the web and vanish when the first rays of the sun struck them. Product Specification: Material: Natural Feather, Cotton Thread, ABS Beads, Iron Ring Color: Grey Large Ring Diamter: 4.3 inches/11 cm. Small Ring Diameter: 2 inches/5 cm. Total Length: 17.7 inches/45 cm. Weight: about 50 g /1.76 oz. Usage：indoor & outdoor decoration Package Includes: 1 x Dream Catcher Safe and Beautiful Wall Hanging Artwork Elegant and attractive design, meticulously handcrafted,safety. The eye-catching ethnic style brings unique visual enjoyment to people. No Scary Dreams During The Night Dream catcher has beautiful symbols, praying for peace and good luck with you, driving out nightmares, sleep with sweet dreams, or wish you a safe journey when driving a car, etc Ideal Home Decoration A perfect wall art decor to hang in your living room, house, window or car or avoiding evils. Dream catcher flying in the wind add a touch of color to your life. Special Gift and Other Application A beautiful and practical gift for your family or friends, also great for Housewarming, Birthday, Wedding, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Valentine's day, Mother's day and other festivals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t8LzZemVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bubqooi","source_asin":"B08MT96127","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MT96127","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MT96127","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
