window.products.push({"id":1122234,"name":"Universal Knife Block, Safe Knife Holder Storage with Slots for Scissors and Sharpening Rod, Detachable for Easy Cleaning, Space Saver Knife Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41arknwQ8-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Save Space & Large Capacity - Make full use of the space of the knife holder, and the 20 or so layers of the compartment can accommodate multiple knives of various sizes. The knife holder measures 5.5 inches on a side and 8.8 inches high and holds up to 15 knives plus a kitchen scissors, a sharpening rod. Double Layer Wave Design - The soft plastic material makes it unnecessary for you to find a position when inserting the knife, you can put knife in as soon as you put it. The inside of the knife organizer adopts a double-layer wave design, the upper and lower layers easily clamp the blade, and it will not fall out but can be easily taken out. Keep Blade Sharp - The bottom of the knife does not touch the bottom of the knife holder and will not damage the blade. To keep the length of the blades sharp as a razor, slide them into the block with back of the knife pressing against the frame instead of the sharp side. Weighted Bottom with Drain Hole - To prevent the knife block from tipping over after inserting heavy knices, we added stainless steel to the inner bottom of the knife block to increase the bottom weight. At the same time, there is a drainage hole in the middle of the bottom, and the excess water flows out from the drainage hole to keep the interior dry. Detachable for Easy Cleaning - The top of the knife block is removable, just put your finger in the hole of the scissors and pull out to remove. (It's a little tight to disassemble it but you just need tear it apart along the edges slowly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41arknwQ8-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siono Star","source_asin":"B09SP93G63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SP93G63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SP93G63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
