window.products.push({"id":1122312,"name":"48 Ounces Borosilicate Glass Pitcher with Lid, Water Jug for Hot/Cold Water, Ice Tea and Juice Beverage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Xynnk+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Karafu elaborate this product for you. Capacity: 1400ml Name: Glass Pitcher / Tea Pitcher / Water Carafe / Drink Pitcher / Beverage Jug  Material: Borosilicate glass with Silica gel and Stainless steel LidDimensions: Height is about 7.9 inches(20 cm including the lid); Bottom length is about 6.7 inches(17 cm including the handle), width is about 5.5 inches(14 cm). Please confirm that you can put it in your refrigerator. Features: 1.Nice looking and very useful. 2.High boron element is used in this product to replace the large number of harmful heavy metal ions occurs in ordinary glass, such as lead and zinc, etc. Human body won't be affected by heavy metal ions in long-term use. 3.The brittleness and weight of the borosilicate glass are at a much lower level than those of ordinary glass. Therefore, the product looks much thinner than that made of ordinary glass, however, it is light and durable. 4.Due to the low expansion coefficient, high softening point and good thermal shock resistance of the high borosilicate, this product can withstand rapid temperature changes from 0°F to 300°F, and it is suitable to boil water and tea on an open flame. 5.The lid made of food grade 18/8 stainless steel and silica gel ensures the healthiness and harmlessness of the whole product. Cleaning Instructions: 1.Cleaning the product with a dishwasher is allowed, however, hand washing is recommended. 2.Please clean the product throughout before using for the first time. 3.It is recommended to clean and dry the product immediately after using to prevent stubborn stains. 4.If there appears stubborn stains such as tea stains, please put the product in a basin or other container with boiled water and vinegar, soak it for 10 minutes, and then wash it with a brush. Notice: The lid doesn't seal, so please don't use it as airtight container.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Xynnk+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karafu","source_asin":"B07G6Q5MZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G6Q5MZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G6Q5MZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122313,"name":"MOSTWOGO Silicone Magnetic Stove Top Shelf, 30\" Length Magnetic Spice Rack Over the Stove, Heat Insulated Kitchen Gadgets - Zero Installation, Baffles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Frd9qrN7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silicone Magnetic Stove Top Magnetic Shelf 30Inch Upgrade Why choose our shelf for your kitchen stove? The stainless steel magnetic shelf on the market is easy to shake and fall after being hit. Your kitchen will be a mess. MOSTWOGO magnetic shelf makes your kitchen more tidy.MOSTWOGO is the first seller on the market with an innovative design of silicone stove top magnetic shelf. Our magnetic shelf will make your kitchen tidier. Our features: √Silicone material. The Spice Rack for Kitchen Stove will not scratch your stove top. √ Non-slip surface, four-sided baffle. The shelf will not easily fall off even if it is hit. √ Good thermal insulation effect. Keep your spices and oils fresh all the time! √ Magnet embedded in the bottom. No installation required, the magnet on the bottom attaches securely to your stove top. √ Can be cropped. When your stove top has a switch, the stove top rack can be freely tailored to fit the stove top. MOSTWOGO is committed to kitchen storage management, only to improve your quality of life. Add to cart now for your peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Frd9qrN7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOSTWOGO","source_asin":"B0C4YQY9P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4YQY9P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4YQY9P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122314,"name":"Pillivuyt Porcelain 11-3/4-Inch Quiche/Flan Baker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21R98D9ZFAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Pillivuyt excels in making the classic French cooking tools and the tart pans are a fine example of this. With graceful fluted edges and a brilliant impermeable glaze, these are dishes you can bring to the table and present your creations directly to your guests or family. The walls of these dishes, as in all Pillivuyt items, are exceptionally even and not too thick, so the heat conduction is even and efficient. This creates an evenly cooked and browned crust that will slide easily out of the pan when you are ready to serve it. You can cut your tart in the pan without worrying about scratching the glaze and the dish will clean up without scrubbing or scraping. Pillivuyt porcelain is fired at 2500 degrees Fahrenheit, so you can safely put any dish under the broiler for that finishing touch and final browning. The 11 3/4 inch tart pan is deeper than the standard pan and will hold larger recipes for quiche or baked egg dishes or deep dish pizzas. It also is a lovely presentation pieces for hot or cold hors d'oeuvres. Amazon.com With its deep and thin, fluted edges, this extra-large 11-3/4-inch round tart with the ideal heat conduction for a nicely browned crust and firm center dish bakes and serves a gigantic caramel flan or a light quiche to a crowd of luncheon guests. The dish is even large enough to be used as a rimmed tray for heating and serving hors d'ouevres at a cocktail party. An exquisite specimen of fine French pottery, this porcelain baker is simple in appearance with its milky white color, smooth finish, and ridged sides yet durable due to its proprietary time-tested ingredients and quality construction. The tart dish's pristine beauty and excellent temperature retention (both hot and cold) make it a wonderful serving vessel that goes from oven or refrigerator to table. Family-founded in 1818, the Pillivuyt porcelain factory still employs skilled artisans who use the original time-honored traditions of handcrafting each piece. Replacement molds are all handmade by craftspeople who have spent many years in training, and who shape them to the level of perfection that this superior bakeware requires. The result is a tough porcelain base that can withstand temperature extremes, making this baker safe to move among the oven, freezer, microwave, or broiler. And, with a little liquid in the baker, the pan can even be placed over a diffused flame on the stovetop. All pieces are glazed and fired at temperatures of about 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, which produces a non-porous, rock-hard finish that easily cleans up by hand or in the dishwasher. The lead-free glaze is resistant to crazing and staining and won't absorb food odors or flavors. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21R98D9ZFAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillivuyt","source_asin":"B0006TJ7B8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006TJ7B8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006TJ7B8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
