window.products.push({"id":1122335,"name":"Melrose International Red Lantern, Set of Two","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QIIzUo3gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Melrose Holiday Set of 2 Decorative Hanging Room Candle Holder Lanterns allow you to accent your space in your individual style with 2 uniquely sized options. Constructed with metal framing and glass panels, these festive room decor lantern lights come in a set of 2 including a large and small lantern. Each candle holder is equipped with vented tops to keep air flowing and reduce smoke build-up. You also have the option to hang these home accessories via the hoops attached to the top of the structure. These versatile lanterns can be displayed with wax or electric candles, filled with seashells, stones, flowers, or any combination of items you feel accent your space. With their rustic finish and elegant mission-style design, these hanging light holders go great on the porch, deck, patio, or inside any room that has empty table space or needs more lighting. The dimensions are as follows: large - 12 inches tall and small - 7.75 inches tall. Keep your space in style on the holidays with these simple but trendy Melrose Decorative Candle Holder Lantern Lights.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QIIzUo3gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melrose","source_asin":"B076MSLRB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076MSLRB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076MSLRB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122336,"name":"Home-X 7-Piece Placemat Set for Round Table, Kitchen Home Decor, Dinnerware Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BM4FOBZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for the perfect set of placemats that will work with your round dining table? This 7-piece set is just what you need to protect your table and add a decorative look, whether your kitchen has a modern, farmhouse, or boho style. This classy set is perfect for a small dinner party or for entertaining in general. The unique wedge shape of these mats makes them the perfect home solution for anyone with a circular dining table. These place settings will protect your table from being damaged by hot food containers. The round centerpiece functions as a trivet for the hot food dishes. Bring these mats out during breakfast, lunch, and dinner to add a more polished look to your table. These wine-colored kitchen decorations are also great to have out during the holidays because they add a warm, cozy feel. They will work well for Thanksgiving and Christmas, so you can use them seasonally or year round depending on your preference and choice of kitchen decor. The possibilities are endless when it comes to centerpiece choices that go with this place setting set. At a birthday party, the middle placemat makes a great place to display the cake on a cute cake stand. Flower arrangements will also look lovely on the round centerpiece. Whether you prefer to adorn your table with a table cloth or not, these placemats will go with whatever you choose. These placemats radiate just the homey feel you are looking for, making them the perfect addition to your everyday table linen set. Protect your table in style with this unique placemat set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BM4FOBZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07PV1LT9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PV1LT9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PV1LT9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
