window.products.push({"id":1122434,"name":"Unicorn Studios WU76826A4 Olokun Owner of The Deep Sea Sculpture - Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41G7GzHmyQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ms. Yvonne Kao, founder of Veronese Design and Unicorn Studio, Inc., first started her own business in collectible sculptures, figurines and home decoration in 1985. The “Veronese Design” brand name was introduced to the marketplace in 1996 and has become synonymous with “High Quality and Exceptional Value” in the international gift and collectible industries. The designs and products have won many acclaims throughout Europe, America and Asia. The Unicorn Studio Inc. was established in 2006 in California to expand product distribution in North America and facilitate a more direct interaction and better service in the marketplace, focusing on both new and established product designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41G7GzHmyQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unicorn Studios","source_asin":"B071WXHFWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071WXHFWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071WXHFWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
