window.products.push({"id":1122454,"name":"SW Swastha Linen Twin Fitted Bed Sheets 100% Organic Cotton, 300 Thread Count Fits Mattress Upto 16 Inches Deep Pocket Hotel Quality Luxury Soft Beddi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bmVJAgYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅100% ORGANIC MANUFACTURE: 100% Organic Cotton procured directly from farmers to make these beautiful Fitted sheets in-house. This 300 Thread Count Sheet is made using Sateen Weave, which gives the sheet soft and silky Attributes. ✅BRING HOME THE PURITY OF ORGANIC: Swastha in the ancient Sanskrit language means Pure & Swastha Linen brings to you the PUREST 100% Certified Organic Cotton Fitted Sheet. The 1 Twin Size Fitted Sheet (39\" X 75\" +16\") with deep pocket to fit mattresses up to 16\", These sheets are manufactured with no harmful chemicals in such a way that it retains softness after washing and are fade resistant. To maintain the softness, we would recommend regular laundering. ✅EASY TO CARE: Machine Wash Warm Separately or with Like Colors. Use Non - Chlorine Bleach When Needed, Tumble Dry on Low Heat Remove Promptly To Avoid Wrinkles. ✅IN-HOUSE QUALITY ASSURANCE : Our entire production unit, cotton fields, supply chain, employee working conditions are put to a rigorous testing periodically. We are proud to be GOTS Certified (A must have certification for any Organic Product), OEKO Tex, BCI certified (We ensure a fair price to the farmers , adequate wages for workers, industry standard labor practices and community engagements). ✅A PRODUCT FOR EVERY OCCASION : This Fitted Sheet is a great gifting choice for all your special occasions – Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthdays, Weddings, and Anniversaries. More than any occasions, it is the best gift you can give to yourself, your family and to everyone whom you want to make a part of organic ecosystem ! Happy Buying!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bmVJAgYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SW SWASTHA LINEN","source_asin":"B086415VCL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086415VCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086415VCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
