window.products.push({"id":1122494,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Flower Garden Rectangular Counter and Stove Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AHPP8XZDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Garden Motif, counter rectangular Amazon.com Part of design is knowing how to divide up a space in blocks of color. The Pfaltzgraff Flower Garden counter and stove mat can create a much-needed splash of color on a neutral stovetop, or maybe it can carve out an area where the salt, pepper, sugar and butter can live. The mat's central rectangle is a green-tinged cream color, and the border alternates two-toned blocks of green with single green leaves or potted plants with lavender flowers, all painted in a country-cottage garden style. Aside from its obvious decorative qualities, the mat can be very useful for resting spoons during cooking or providing a nonskid surface for drinks on slippery countertops, for example. It could even be used on a buffet table as a serving surface for a selection of cheeses, cookies, or hors d'oeuvres. The Flower Garden counter and stove mat is safe for use on most stove surfaces between the burners; it can be easily washed with a warm, soapy cloth or sponge. The Pfaltzgraff Company has been in business in America for nearly two hundred years and is a trusted name in ceramics and patterned kitchenware. All Pfaltzgraff patterns are available for registry by the company. Pfaltzgraff's 5-year in-stock promise guarantees that basic pieces in any registered pattern will be available for five years after a pattern is discontinued (this applies only to patterns discontinued after 2002). --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AHPP8XZDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B0001GUCAG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001GUCAG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001GUCAG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
