window.products.push({"id":1122497,"name":"MERRYHOME Diamond Marquee LED Letter Signs: White Light Up with Remote Timer Dimmable for Party Wedding Birthday Decor, Alphabet Wall Decoration Lette","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MnymaQmfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Diamond letter lamp design】Light Up Letters for Wall Decor create a luxurious atmosphere. You can freely combine words such as \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY\", \"MARRY ME, \"I LOVE YOU \", \"HOME\", etc. to facilitate the combination and create a colorful atmosphere to attract people's attention. Different from the ordinary letter lights you see, the latest 18-color 7-mode color-changing design can meet your different color needs.Timing turn off lights in 4hours / 6hours /8hours for Options. 【32 Keys Remote Control】Function Remote Control：Point the 32 keys remote Control to the Letter Lamp , turn on the lights, choose your favorite colors, speed, modes (FADE, JUMP, ASYN FADE, ASYN JUMP, TWINKLE, STROBE, WAVES) for children’s birthday, Christmas celebration, Halloween or wedding party. CREATE IN YOUR WAY: The diamond colorful letter light is perfect to create romantic and surprise atmosphere. 【Light up Letters for Wall & Table Decor】Each diamond marquee letters sign designed with flat bottom, which can be placed on the table steadily during your event or celebration. Our decorative letter sign can also be hung on walls with keyhole slot in back. No need to take the letters off wall. 【Perfect for Decorative LED Letter Lights】You can spell out related themes and hang or place them as you like. Suitable for any family, bedroom, children's room, cafe, bar, hotel, gym, club or any occasion, such as family gatherings, weddings, Christmas, birthdays, graduation parties and other festivals. 【Easy to Light up Letters】 Just uses 2AA batteries(NOT included but included Remote). Marquee letters can be hung (has keyhole slot in back for easy hanging) on walls, mantels or placed on top of a reception table during your event or celebration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MnymaQmfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MERRYHOME","source_asin":"B09YNFKGWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YNFKGWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YNFKGWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122498,"name":"LEAP Instant Read Meat Thermometer with Backlight and Calibration, Magnetic Ultra Fast Candy Thermometer, Waterproof Digital Cooking Food Thermometer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611N5oX95vL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"{ULTRA FAST & ACCURATE } Meat thermometer for grilling reads temperature at a blazing 2-3 seconds.No more waiting over a hot stove or grill for the temperature to settle.And guarantees an accurate temp reading to ±0.1°C (±0.2°F) with a wide temp range of -50°C~300°C（-50°C~300°C）. Accuracy makes your food more delicious. {IP 67 RATED WATERPROOF} A IP 67 rated waterproof digital thermometer can be washed easily without fear that water gets inside. You can wipe clean the probe or give the kitchen food thermometer a QUICK rinse if the shell gets dirty during your cooking.The meat thermometer's body made of strong ABS plastic, if drop, it will not get worse. {LARGE BACKLIT DISPLAY & QULITY PROBE} The large bright LCD display with backlight makes BBQ thermometer very easy to read out while cooking outdoors on a sunny day or at night.The probe is made of food safety 304 stainless steel :4.5 inch long probe with ultra-thin 1.7mm pointed head. Go easily deep into the center of large turkey, thick ribeye, small fish steak and liquid .The meat thermometer has 10.7 inch in length to protect your hands from burning while measuring. {SMART DESIGN & POWERFUL FUNACTION}EASY to use,a temperature chart is printed on the front of the shell for your reference.And the kitchen candy thermometer with foldable probe design folds away easily and locks into base for portability .Also this food thermometer can be viewing with 180°rotation.Open the probe to turn on, Fold the pro be to turn off, auto-shut off after 10 mins to save battery.Built in bottle opener to open bottle easily and magnetic back & hook allows for convenient storage {VARIETY OCCASIONS AND SERVICE }Makes this perfect cooking thermometer for Steak, beef, chicken, turkey,baking, frying, smoking salmon, pork, toasted bread, cake, bath water, yogurt, milk, coffee, tea, soup,candy and so on. Buy kitchen thermometer now and get a lifetime warranty and a 100% money back guarantee if you are not satisfied with the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611N5oX95vL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEAP","source_asin":"B08BRTFVXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BRTFVXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BRTFVXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
