window.products.push({"id":1122643,"name":"GOTSEVEN, Electric Can Opener, Mini Restaurant Can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener (White), Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ndpRayUkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"HOW DO I OPEN THE BATTERY COMPARTMENT? Recently, we received a issue with our can openers where the battery cover is difficult to open. here are some instructions for how to open these if you received one of the units: STEP 1: Find the can opener's anti-slip edge. STEP 2: Press the skid-proof edge on left side and push back gently. STEP 3: Same operation on the right side. STEP 4: Pull it back together and open it. At a Glance: ? Start and stop feature for hands-free opening ? Automatically open cans in seconds, operated by 2 AA batteries (Not Included) ? Sleek, low profile design for easy storage ? Hygienic - Cuts from side of can without leaving sharp edges, lid will never falls into can and touch on food ? Materials - ABS, TPE, Stainless Steel Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ndpRayUkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOTSEVEN","source_asin":"B08QZ2VPQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QZ2VPQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QZ2VPQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122644,"name":"LeeEv Bento Box for Adults, Leak Proof Bento Lunch with Utensils & Insulated Lunch Bag, BPA-Free/Food-Safe Durable Materials Microwavable Adult Lunch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QX8a22wSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bento Lunch Box with Three Compartments, With Utensils, Lunch Bag: Three compartment can separate different foods to maintain the original flavor of the food, no mixed taste. Portioned perfectly for adult. The utensils are integrated into the lid, its special design makes you never forget Bring a fork and spoon. The lunch containers with portion control help you keep your diet plan and lose weight. Keep Food Fresh, Perfect Bento Lunch Boxes For Your Healthy Meals: The lunch box has leak-proof design, upgrade airtight lid features a rubberized sealing ring and locking clips to keep food fresh and leak-proof on the go. NOTE: the compartments not seal up from each other, not recommended to hold water or sauces. LeeEv reusable bento boxes for adults are easy to use, wash, and store. Bento Box Safe to Use/Easy to Clean: Microwave safe(NOTE: please remove the lid before microwave, 2-4 mins under 248℉); Freezer safe(≧-4℉). Dishwasher safe: hand washing is recommended for the lid to preserve the leak-proof seal (high temperature and pressure washing may cause deformation of the lid). Safe Material & Durable: Made of food grade materials and are BPA free, odorless and stain resistant. The meal storage containers can be easily opened using the convenient flaps of the lids, and has enough capacity to accommodate food for adults. The drop resistant, sturdy and durable material design is ideal for lunches. Practical Bento Lunch Box: Dimensions 7.8 x 5.1 x 2.7 inches, lightweight and easy to carry. the perfect design of 1100 ml vs 37 oz makes the bento lunch box for large capacity and light weight. Lighter than a glass container which is great for work lunches, and dining out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QX8a22wSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LeeEv","source_asin":"B0BNC4HF3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNC4HF3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNC4HF3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
