window.products.push({"id":1122749,"name":"Veronese Design Vintage TLR Camera Decorative Bronze Finish Single Bookend Statue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hsDPKhUzL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Whether you are a photographer or just love anything antique, this statue of an old fashioned camera makes a fabulous bookend for living room, library or office. It features a metallic bronze finish with hand painted touches that allow you to see all the highlights and shadows in the highly detailed and textured sculpture. Adds a hint of the vintage to any bookcase or shelf, even if you are not much of a book lover. You can even set it on an end table or use it as a paperweight on your desk. Makes a great gift for the any professional or amateur photogs, camera collectors, or just those who hark to a time gone by.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hsDPKhUzL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veronese Design","source_asin":"B01M231QUR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M231QUR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M231QUR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
