window.products.push({"id":1122751,"name":"Treasures Gifted Gold 2020 Foil Number Balloons 40 Inch Jumbo 2020 Silver Mylar Number Balloons Congratulation Banner Signs for University College Hig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F-iwTxlLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Treasures Gifted: Make Celebrations Extraordinary CONGRATULATIONS ON A JOB WELL DONE! Your 2019 was a great year. Now it's time to celebrate a brand new beginning! Whether you are celebrating a ball dropping restart, or academic graduation. We want to help you say congratulations loud and clear! Your graduation is indeed worth celebrating! These attention-grabbing 2020 balloons are giant! They are 40 inches in height because we believe your success is worth acknowledging this loud! It is a significant milestone in your life, and you deserve a larger-than-life celebration! You can also use these number balloons on a variety of occasions like 20th and 2nd birthdays. 202nd and 200th anniversary. Mix and match according to your needs! Balloon Decoration Must- know: * Foil balloons will stay inflated with helium between 6-8 hours and 8-10 hours with air. * Inflate balloons an hour before the party instead of the night before, so they last throughout the event. * When inflating, fill just enough to allow wrinkles near the seam, so there is extra room for air or helium to expand in case the weather temperature changes. * For a longer floating time, use quality helium and fill to the balloon to the point you can press down a bit on it. * Inflating the balloons to maximum full can result in tearing balloon walls or broken seams. * Never release foil balloons in the sky. It is prohibited in many states to use foil balloons outdoors. CAUTION: * Blow up balloons with an electronic or manual hand pump to avoid damages to the self-sealing valve. * Popped balloons are a choking hazard to children under 8 years. WHAT YOU'LL GET: A set of four giant 2, 0, 2, 0 foil balloons 40 inches in color gold and silver (2 each). Free 11 Yards Of White Curling Ribbon FREE Printable Party Planning Kit\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F-iwTxlLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Treasures Gifted","source_asin":"B081M8HLMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081M8HLMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081M8HLMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122752,"name":"America Sequesters CO2 BioCharlie Make Biochar in Your Fireplace Let Your Fireplace Go Green Tonight with This Hand Crafted Fireplace Accessory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dd7k0Lk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let your fireplace go green tonight and enjoy the warmth like never before. The BioCharlie is a biochar making metal log that fits into your fireplace, wood stove, or outdoor fire pit. It is roughly the size of a fireplace log and looks like a log when in the fire. It is designed to make a small amount of biochar and may be re-used over and over, whenever you want to relax by your fireplace. The making of biochar helps the environment by transforming kindling wood or any biomass into an extremely stable state of carbon. When the char is mixed into soil, the carbon is locked away for up to a millennium or longer. Biochar helps the soil by holding on to nutrients and fertilizers needed by plants inhibiting them from being washed away. It encourages microbial growth while absorbing water and keeping the soil more drought resistant. You will enjoy your fireplace way more than ever before, knowing that you are doing your part to help your planet. Photos show the BioCharlie transforming kindling wood into biochar. Kindling wood is not included with product. You can use your BioCharlie to turn many things into biochar including wood chips, sticks and branches, scrap lumber, wood pellets, cardboard, nuts, bones, etc. The BioCharlie (patent pending) is hand crafted in the USA using American made galvanized steel. It is approximately 18 inches in length with a five inch diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dd7k0Lk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"America Sequesters CO2","source_asin":"B00ZYS1DWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZYS1DWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZYS1DWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
