window.products.push({"id":1122781,"name":"Lemon Squeezer or Lime Press, Manual Citrus Juicer, Large Size ,Stainless Steel by Kufu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P-7OScOIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Tips to get more juice Cut the fruit into halves. Put one of them into the squeezer.  Please note the flesh section should face down while the peel section should face up. If you put it in wrong direction, the juice may spray out and you cannot get all the juice.  Please remember to pick up the seeds, or the juice may get a little bitter.  If you are squeezing a big orange, cut it to quarters might be better. Juices Lemons and Limes to the Last Drop With one powerful plier motion, the nesting bowls squeeze every bit of juice from your lemon or lime; unlike reamers which force you to dig around and around, and still not get it all. The juice falls straight down onto your food, instead of squirting sideways. And even the tiniest seeds and bits of pith are trapped in the bowl. Order now and Don't Miss Out! Take advantage of our 100% Lifetime Money Back Guarantee. If for any reason you're not completely satisfied, return your Lemon Press for a No Questions Asked Full Refund. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P-7OScOIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kufu","source_asin":"B01HBALYUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HBALYUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HBALYUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
