window.products.push({"id":1122834,"name":"vancasso Bonita Multicolour Cereal Bowl, Handpainted Spirals Pattern Stoneware Soup Bowl, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lu3l11L0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Practical Cereal Bowl】The size of this cereal bowl is 5.5 * 3.2 inches， which is large enough for ramen, cereal, dessert, breakfast, or ice cream. Also, they are very deep and can be used as a salad bowl, pasta bowl, soup bowl, or mixing bowl. The bowls feel strong but not too thick and can survive multiple cycles of the dishwasher. 【Chic Dessert Bowls in Warm Tones】The 6 different colors were glazed on both sides of the bowls, harmonious and beautiful. The modern swirl design like a lollipop gives people an infinitely sweet, which fits its title BONITA, translated into beautiful in Portuguese. The edge of the plate is outlined with brown eyelash lines, making the tableware more artistic and unique. 【Fine Stoneware Material】Made from more carefully selected and blended dense stoneware, twice fired at high temperatures to make it strong and nonporous. More durable than other kinds of pottery and earthenware. It can also stand up to the heat from the microwave. Stoneware also distributes and retains heat more evenly than other types of pottery. 【Decorate Your Table】This salad bowl is characterized by its sophisticated multicolor and even glossy glaze. Giving a stylish impression, it suits both the modern and the rustic natural atmosphere. Everything tastes better and the mood is better when using these bowls. 【Phenomenal After-Sale Care】If the item you received couldn't up to your standard, please feel free to contact us. And we will arrange the replacement to ensure you get the high-quality products you paid for. We are also happy to issue a refund if it's requested, we promise we won't let our customer suffer any loss.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lu3l11L0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vancasso","source_asin":"B09Q5ZRV8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q5ZRV8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q5ZRV8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
