window.products.push({"id":1122861,"name":"Howard Miller Hadley Mantel Clock 630-222 – Oak Yorkshire, Key Wound Single Chime Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1149.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-9--kxSRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MANTEL CLOCK: The Hadley Mantel Clock features an Oak Yorkshire finish on select hardwoods and rare elm burl veneers to compliment your home decor. Place it above your fireplace in the living room for a classic decorative piece with beaded molding on the base and carved side scrolls. DURABLE: This tambour clock has a sturdy frame to relieve stress in a busy household with durable bronze bushings. This timepiece has black Arabic numerals, black serpentine hands, and convex glass crystal to stand out over a lamb’s-wool dial. CHIMES: Easily tell time with the key-wound, single-chime movement that plays the Westminster chime to strike each hour. An industry exclusive dual-ratchet winding arbor ensures safe movement winding. Use the chime silence option to place anywhere in the house. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 10.75 inches (27 cm), with a width of 17.5 inches (44 cm) and a depth of 6.5 inches (17 cm). It is powered by key-wound, single-chime movement. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-9--kxSRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B000YDD6PY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000YDD6PY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000YDD6PY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
