window.products.push({"id":1122948,"name":"Ronco Ready Grill, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-MaObglnL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The Ronco RG1001BLGEN ready grill in black offers all of the BBQ style taste of an outdoor grill, plus, the satisfaction of speed, convenience, cleaning ease and no smoke. Four heating elements grill both sides at once, sealing in the juices instantly and locking in the delicious flavor of your foods. The ready grill evenly browns chicken, seafood, vegetables, chops, steaks, hamburgers, sausages, hams, ribs and even a variety of frozen food. The timer makes it easy to use and automatically shuts off when the allotted cooking time is up. A two-position grill basket allows grilling a variety of food from thin to thick and leave beautiful, mouth-watering grill marks. A removable drip tray is located at the base of the Ronco ready grill collecting grease, fat, crumbs, etc. For ease of cleaning the heat shields and basket guides are removable. To help get you started sample recipes are included in the owner's manual. The small design is great for smaller kitchens, apartments and RV's. Optional accessories available for the ready grill include, the ready grill cookbook, mesh basket with kabob rods and steamer basket, sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-MaObglnL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ronco","source_asin":"B01B4B567K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B4B567K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B4B567K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122949,"name":"Ikiriska Add Curtain Tape with Hooks to Our Custom Curtains. Perfect for Ceiling Track System or rods with Curtain Rings or use as Back tab. (100\" Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nSkR3gO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The price is for adding/sewing our tape with hooks to 1 of our custom made panel. CURTAINS ARE NOT INCLUDED. You can buy curtains from us or sent us your curtains and we will attach the tape. Free hooks included (10 hooks for panel 50\" wide and 20 hooks for panel 100\" wide)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nSkR3gO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ikiriska","source_asin":"B07SSPY7SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SSPY7SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SSPY7SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1122950,"name":"Yoshihiro Hayate Inox Aus-8 Kiritsuke Japanese Multipurpose Chefs Knife Integrated Stainless Handle (9.5'' (240mm))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510iedZRTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Knife Features → Blade Material: INOX Aus-8 Stainless Steel  →Edge Angle: Double Edged  →Grade: INOX  →Handle Shape: Western Integrated  →Handle Material: Stainless Steel  →HRC:60  →Knife Style: Kiritsuke Multipurpose Knife  →Stain Resistant: Yes  INOX Aus-8 is commonly used in high-end Japanese knives and provides a good foundation to build a knife with well-rounded attributes. The craftsmanship on the blade is impeccable with attention to detail that only hands on work can provide. The quality of the steel together with its' expert craftsmanship makes this a professional quality chefs knife with an excellent blend of razor sharpness, durability, and comfort that is unrivaled in its price range.The Kiritsuke is one of the most versatile and essential of all knives a cook can have. The blade of the Kiritsuke is wider and straighter than a standard chef knife while having a curved tip. The wideness of the knife with its straight end makes it suited for chopping vegetables while the long curved tip makes it suitable for cutting thin slices in meat or fish. Proudly made in Japan and not mass produced. This knife is complimented with a premium Western Style Handle that extends to the full tang of the knife and ergonomically welds to the hand for seamless use. This particular knife series emphasizes a superior cutting edge by utilizing an exceptionally thin blade design that will effortlessly cut through ingredients with very little abrasions to its surface.Traditional Japanese knife making values a sharp edge, which requires attention and care. Sharpening and honing should be done with only water whetstones. Hand wash and dry only, and do so immediately if working with acidic ingredients. Do not use on objects such as bones, nutshells, and frozen foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510iedZRTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoshihiro","source_asin":"B00KTPBFE6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KTPBFE6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KTPBFE6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
