window.products.push({"id":1122974,"name":"Kitchen Sink Sponge Holder, Stainless Steel Organizer Basket, Faucet Shelf Dish Brush Rack Storage for Sponges, Scrubbers, Soap, Cloths | Black (A - S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WJOw1-oBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for elegant large sponge holders? Or sponge holder shelves with a hanger that attaches to your faucet? Well, these kitchen sink faucet sponge holders are your easy solution. Made of quality stainless steel & held by a strong ABC plastic piece that attaches to your faucet, they are your fast and space-saving solution to boost kitchen maintenance & cleaning productivity. ▶ Highly Functional Available in 3 different style variants (1 of them features 2 shelves), you are sure to have enough space to store & organize sponges, rags, brushes, scrubbers, cloths and bar soap in a neat and efficient way. Use at your home or in your commercial kitchen to have all your sponges, soaps & kitchen accessories close by your side. ▶ Easy Installation Easily open the plastic piece and secure the holder to your faucet at any height you find optimal. Close it and start organizing your sponges and other kitchen accessories. ▶ Long-lasting The strong ABC plastic is resistant to water and super-durable allowing strong holding power for years to come. The stainless-steel frames are rust-resistant and reinforced in a super-strong construction that will stay as good as new for a long-time. ▶ Matches any décor A combination of two neutral colors (black & white) with a nicely polished finish, the sponge holders fits perfectly into any interior kitchen décor styles. Now don’t wait any longer to organize all your sponges, brushes & cloths in a productive way. Click Add to Cart and get this kitchen faucet sponge holder RISK-FREE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WJOw1-oBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEHE","source_asin":"B08G44WDBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1122974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G44WDBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G44WDBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
